      "title": "Important papers",
      "body": "On a parent's page, drop copies of the power of attorney, health care proxy and insurance cards into Files. They are stored encrypted inside Pulse."
    },
    {
      "title": "Hospital stay",
      "body": "Start the Hospital stay checklist on their page so nothing gets forgotten, and print the handoff packet for the hospital team."
    }
